  - B4_PLXG_SAME_SEQ_ABA: present_geom_latch.sv accepts commit only when `sh_seq != last_seq` with no epoch/session token. After FPGA reset last_seq=0, retained DDR q0 seq=N can ABA on restart (rd-duck #4; host plxg_record.hpp documents the class — RTL still open). [fix=unmerged lane=w-mem tip=90517fa262d4 ts=2026-08-03 05:12:19 -0500 artefact=fpga/Plex_MiSTer/rtl/present_geom_latch.sv evidence='live scan matched 2 patterns @ tip']
  - B6_HBLANK_OLD_HC_EPOCH: present_beam_content_de.sv must drive HBlank/VBlank/HSync from hc_next/vc_next (same epoch as registered counters). Old-hc NBA blank drops store x=0 every line (store_id_checked=959*540=517860 vs de_pixels=518400) — rd-duck 34ddf031 scalar-ascal proof. [fix=unmerged lane=w-scaler tip=3c872e8e1ac7 ts=2026-08-03 05:11:28 -0500 artefact=fpga/Plex_MiSTer/rtl/present_beam_content_de.sv evidence='live scan matched 2 patterns @ tip' static_tag=bb4e5346 tip_newer=1]
  - B7_OPTC_WIDTH_ONLY: ddr_frame_store.sv selects Option-C via `rt_cw_cl >= 11'd1280` (or lacks rt_need_optc/rt_payload_bytes/LEG_BANK_USABLE capacity path). Product 960×540 is <1280 wide but 777600 B > 520192 B legacy usable and MUST use Option-C — width gate overruns LEG bank (rd-duck; w-mem capacity fix is the reference). [fix=unmerged lane=w-mem tip=90517fa262d4 ts=2026-08-03 05:12:19 -0500 artefact=fpga/Plex_MiSTer/rtl/ddr_frame_store.sv evidence='live scan matched 3 patterns @ tip' static_tag=e82e5d5e tip_newer=1]
  - B7_PRESENT_CORE_NO_OPTC_PHYS: present_core.sv ddr_frame_store #() does not pass .PHYS_BASE_720P(...) — only legacy PHYS_BASE/stride/doorbell. Merge/verify PLXG Option-C param wiring (w-mem present_core reference). [fix=unmerged lane=w-mem tip=90517fa262d4 ts=2026-08-03 05:12:19 -0500 artefact=fpga/Plex_MiSTer/rtl/present_core.sv evidence='live scan matched 1 patterns @ tip' static_tag=a1fad081 tip_newer=1]
  - B7_PRESENT_CORE_NO_OPTC_STRIDE: present_core.sv missing .HPS_BANK_STRIDE_BYTES_720P(...) on ddr_frame_store [fix=unmerged lane=w-mem tip=90517fa262d4 ts=2026-08-03 05:12:19 -0500 artefact=fpga/Plex_MiSTer/rtl/present_core.sv evidence='live scan matched 1 patterns @ tip' static_tag=a1fad081 tip_newer=1]
  - B7_PRESENT_CORE_NO_OPTC_DOORBELL: present_core.sv missing .DOORBELL_PHYS_720P(...) on ddr_frame_store [fix=unmerged lane=w-mem tip=90517fa262d4 ts=2026-08-03 05:12:19 -0500 artefact=fpga/Plex_MiSTer/rtl/present_core.sv evidence='live scan matched 1 patterns @ tip' static_tag=a1fad081 tip_newer=1]
  - B7_FIT_CARD_CAPACITY_CLAIM: docs/ascal-true-de-fit-card.md mentions usable-capacity while ddr_frame_store still width-gates Option-C — do not treat the card claim as present code (rd-duck). [fix=unimplemented — no known sibling-lane fix; new work]
  - B8_PLXG_WR_COMMIT_TIED_ZERO: Plex.sv has plxg_wr_en=1'b0 and plxg_commit=1'b0 (lines ~239–242 class). fabric_geom_enable stays 0; geom/window latch never leaves reset-zero. PRESENT_BEAM_960 alone does not program content/geom (rd-duck product hierarchy). [fix=unmerged lane=w-mem tip=90517fa262d4 ts=2026-08-03 05:12:19 -0500 artefact=fpga/Plex_MiSTer/Plex.sv evidence='live scan matched 2 patterns @ tip']
  - B8_CONTENT_BASE_NOT_960: Plex.sv content_width_base falls back to O[4] 640×480 / 320×240 when PLXG idle — and there is no live product path that programs content_w/h from PMS-delivered geometry (max tier 960×540). Thin true_de TB drives 960 ports directly; product hierarchy does not (rd-duck). Gate inspects Plex.sv, not the harness. Do not clear by hardcoding only 960 — that fails B13. [fix=unmerged lane=w-mem tip=90517fa262d4 ts=2026-08-03 05:12:19 -0500 artefact=fpga/Plex_MiSTer/rtl/plex_present_geom_mux.sv evidence='live scan matched 3 patterns @ tip']
  - B8_FORCE_GEOM_1280_NOT_960: only FABRIC_NATIVE_720P_GEOM force path exists and it sets content+geom to 1280×720, not 960×540. Cannot substitute for ascal true-DE 960 product wiring (rd-duck). [fix=unmerged lane=w-mem tip=90517fa262d4 ts=2026-08-03 05:12:19 -0500 artefact=fpga/Plex_MiSTer/rtl/plex_present_geom_mux.sv evidence='live scan matched 3 patterns @ tip']
  - B9_ASPECT_ORIGINAL_4_3: Plex.sv defaults VIDEO_ARX/ARY to 4/3 when status[122:121]==Original (`(!ar)?12'd4` / `12'd3`). A 960×540 true-DE input is 16:9 content and will present as 4:3 unless Full Screen (ARX=ARY=0) or 16:9 is forced. Scalar proof must `ifdef PRESENT_BEAM_960` force FS/16:9 (or FIT_FORCE_AR_*) — fit card omitted aspect (rd-duck). [fix=unmerged lane=w-mem tip=90517fa262d4 ts=2026-08-03 05:12:19 -0500 artefact=fpga/Plex_MiSTer/Plex.sv evidence='live scan matched 3 patterns @ tip']
  - B14_CODED_W_16_ALIGN_UNENFORCED: ddr_frame_store.sv must reject non-16-aligned coded_w (rt_coded_w[3:0]==0 in rt_raw_aligned → rt_raw_ok). Parent lab: PMS AR-fit widths 468/638/626 fail 16-align; chroma fetch is coded_w>>4. Silent accept = UV plane corruption. Observed defect class, not speculative. [fix=unmerged lane=w-mem tip=90517fa262d4 ts=2026-08-03 05:12:19 -0500 artefact=fpga/Plex_MiSTer/rtl/ddr_frame_store.sv evidence='live scan matched 2 patterns @ tip' static_tag=e82e5d5e tip_newer=1]
  - B12_DE_LAG_RGB_LATENCY_UNPROVEN: present_core.sv still states DE_LAG has NOT been re-swept for DDR path (measured at 640-class). No 960 store/RGB latency closure — gate refuses fit until lag is re-proven for max-tier / runtime DE path (rd-duck adc9292). [fix=unmerged lane=w-mem tip=90517fa262d4 ts=2026-08-03 05:12:19 -0500 artefact=fpga/Plex_MiSTer/rtl/present_core.sv evidence='live scan matched 1 patterns @ tip']
  - B13_FIXED_RASTER_NO_RUNTIME_DE: product hardcodes a fixed content DE (present_beam_content_de parameter H_DE/V_ACTIVE defaults 960×540; present_core `PRESENT_BEAM_960` binds .H_DE(960),.V_ACTIVE(540) / H_DE_I=960) with no runtime ports driven from delivered content_w/h. Parent PMS lab: SD source 320×240 is delivered as 320×240 (no upscale). True-DE architecture requires DE==content at runtime; 960×540 is the maximum tier, not a fixed raster. Asserts against beam+present_core RTL. [fix=unmerged lane=w-clock tip=b110520899ed ts=2026-08-03 05:15:45 -0500 artefact=fpga/Plex_MiSTer/rtl/present_core.sv evidence='live scan matched 3 patterns @ tip' static_tag=5b1cbe46 tip_newer=1]
